247
00:18:02,000 --> 00:18:06,720
Then I found out that the devil's curse in the Heart Kingdom is on Queen Laura Petchka herself

248
00:18:07,440 --> 00:18:10,720
I will get stronger because that's my only path forward

249
00:18:10,720 --> 00:18:15,680
I'll protect all the people I can back home and here in the Heart Kingdom too

250
00:18:17,120 --> 00:18:19,600
I'm glad that you allowed me to hear your tale

251
00:18:19,600 --> 00:18:21,440
It was truly enlightening

252
00:18:21,440 --> 00:18:26,960
I finally understand how you became so powerful despite the fact that you're utterly spurned by mana

253
00:18:26,960 --> 00:18:30,160
Now let us begin

254
00:18:31,120 --> 00:18:34,880
The sun will be setting shortly but we can spar nonetheless

255
00:18:34,880 --> 00:18:38,080
I'll train you as long as you'd like in the dark if need be

256
00:18:38,880 --> 00:18:39,440
Ooh

257
00:18:39,440 --> 00:18:39,840
Right

258
00:18:39,840 --> 00:18:41,840
You wait

259
00:18:55,360 --> 00:18:55,920
It's amazing

260
00:19:01,920 --> 00:19:03,660
You

261
00:19:03,820 --> 00:19:05,440
Now I'm lost

262
00:19:05,440 --> 00:19:06,520
I want to be

263
00:19:06,520 --> 00:19:13,220
Excellent. Noelle, that was a sight to behold.

264
00:19:13,440 --> 00:19:14,880
You put on quite the show.

265
00:19:15,160 --> 00:19:18,340
I think anyone could see that you've improved since you first arrived here.

266
00:19:18,520 --> 00:19:22,200
Well, since I'm royalty myself, I'm a fairly quick study.

267
00:19:22,740 --> 00:19:25,740
I can't believe it! She actually praised me!

268
00:19:26,360 --> 00:19:29,500
In truth, you're the one who's amazing, Water Spirit Andine.

269
00:19:29,500 --> 00:19:33,740
You keep finding new ways to draw out more and more of my water magic.

270
00:19:33,740 --> 00:19:38,360
Thank you for the compliment, but you aren't the only one who's growing fast.

271
00:19:38,800 --> 00:19:39,880
Take a look at this.

272
00:19:42,240 --> 00:19:43,720
It's not just you and Nero.

273
00:19:44,060 --> 00:19:49,020
Your comrades from the Clover Kingdom are learning Heart Kingdom techniques faster than we ever could have imagined.

274
00:19:49,320 --> 00:19:51,780
They're all getting stronger just as fast as you are.

275
00:19:52,400 --> 00:19:57,400
We may be fast, but we still aren't as strong as we need to be to defeat the Devil and the Spade Kingdom.

276
00:19:58,980 --> 00:19:59,420
Right?

277
00:20:00,540 --> 00:20:02,440
Yes, you're exactly right.

278
00:20:02,440 --> 00:20:05,100
That said, I have complete faith in each of you.

279
00:20:05,740 --> 00:20:08,200
The Magic Knights who were training so diligently here,

280
00:20:08,620 --> 00:20:12,480
and your comrades who stayed behind to help prepare the Clover Kingdom for war.

281
00:20:13,220 --> 00:20:19,520
If we all work together, then in time a ray of hope will break through the Spade Kingdom Devil's Cloud of Despair.

282
00:20:20,280 --> 00:20:22,540
In fact, I'm certain that we'll win.

283
00:20:22,540 --> 00:20:29,200
And when we do, I'll avenge my mother.

284
00:20:29,200 --> 00:20:41,320
You shouldn't expect the same trick to work twice.

285
00:20:41,320 --> 00:20:57,080
That move is strong, but as it is now, you can only land a hit with it reliably if you catch your opponent by surprise.

286
00:20:57,080 --> 00:21:01,180
Scenes will finish before dark.

287
00:21:01,880 --> 00:21:03,040
Lightning magic.

288
00:21:04,020 --> 00:21:04,620
Tengiolia.

289
00:21:05,800 --> 00:21:06,780
Not yet!

290
00:21:06,780 --> 00:21:12,280
The leaves of a Clover are set to each contain one thing.

291
00:21:12,540 --> 00:21:15,740
In the first three dwell integrity, hope, and love.

292
00:21:16,220 --> 00:21:18,360
The fourth thing is given over to good luck.

293
00:21:19,080 --> 00:21:20,440
And in the fifth...

294
00:21:20,440 --> 00:21:23,260
There lives a Devil.

295
00:21:23,260 --> 00:21:32,100
Wait, my sword...

296
00:21:32,100 --> 00:21:33,700
What the...

297
00:21:33,700 --> 00:21:38,400
Your capacity for growth continues to surprise me.

298
00:21:38,860 --> 00:21:41,280
In order to reveal the extent of your hidden powers,

299
00:21:41,580 --> 00:21:43,740
I'll attack you with everything I have.

300
00:21:44,180 --> 00:21:46,660
That is, if you think you can withstand more.

301
00:21:47,120 --> 00:21:48,640
Yeah, give me everything you've got!

302
00:21:48,640 --> 00:22:00,200
Things are starting to get interesting now.

303
00:22:00,200 --> 00:22:01,700
Ha ha ha.

304
00:22:18,640 --> 00:22:19,760
No, my way.

305
00:22:19,760 --> 00:22:29,820
Haleに転んで傷ついて気づけば誰ももうどこにもいない

306
00:22:29,820 --> 00:22:41,700
歪んだ世界に魔法の言葉で光が射すなら飛びつくんだろう

307
00:22:41,700 --> 00:22:50,880
今目の前に残るのは希望か

308
00:22:50,880 --> 00:22:58,880
掴みかけた若かな幸福か

309
00:22:58,880 --> 00:23:01,580
まだ消せない誓い叫んでる

310
00:23:01,580 --> 00:23:03,880
忘れないように叫んでる

311
00:23:03,880 --> 00:23:06,360
泣きたいほど遠くだって

312
00:23:06,360 --> 00:23:08,880
全然届かなくても

313
00:23:08,880 --> 00:23:13,460
信じる君は赤いで前を向いている

314
00:23:13,460 --> 00:23:16,380
だから枯れないように抗って

315
00:23:16,380 --> 00:23:19,720
描いた夢また歩き出せる

316
00:23:19,720 --> 00:23:21,060
きっと

317
00:23:21,060 --> 00:23:23,060
僕を

318
00:23:23,060 --> 00:23:24,560
呼ぶ声だ

319
00:23:24,560 --> 00:23:36,780
僕が家のペイ支配近

320
00:23:36,780 --> 00:23:46,440
ご視聴いただきありがとうございました

321
00:23:46,440 --> 00:23:49,200
Clover Kingdom, and everyone in the Heart Kingdom too!

